WEBVTT

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:30.701
As I think about it, man,

00:05:31.744 --> 00:05:34.205
I think three, five, 10 years from now,

00:05:34.246 --> 00:05:37.875
if we circle back to the conversation
about what do you want to be,

00:05:37.917 --> 00:05:40.920
and I pose that question
again to my young boys,

00:05:41.921 --> 00:05:44.507
maybe we can add
a couple of names to those lists.

00:05:44.548 --> 00:05:47.426
Maybe we can say Kevin Durant,
LeBron James

00:05:47.468 --> 00:05:49.220
and also Mr. Halstead,

00:05:49.261 --> 00:05:51.555
and maybe even Mr. Irving.

00:05:51.597 --> 00:05:52.848
Yeah. Mr. Irving.

00:05:53.557 --> 00:05:54.892
I like the ring of that.

00:05:55.726 --> 00:05:56.977
Thank you.